UnitBasePoolTape::constructor
├── when the default cadence interval is eq to zero
│   └── it reverts with ZeroCadenceInterval
└── when the default cadence interval is gt zero
    ├── it sets the owner
    ├── it stores the default cadence interval
    └── it emits DefaultCadenceIntervalSet

UnitBasePoolTape::setDefaultCadenceInterval
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when the interval is eq to zero
    │   └── it reverts with ZeroCadenceInterval
    └── when the interval is gt zero
        ├── it updates the default cadence interval
        └── it emits DefaultCadenceIntervalSet

UnitBasePoolTape::setPoolCadence
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── it stores the per pool cadence
    ├── it emits PoolCadenceSet
    └── when the cadence is eq to zero
        └── it stores the default cadence

UnitBasePoolTape::setAllowedCallerAndInitializePool
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── it stores the authorized caller
    ├── it emits AllowedCallerSet
    ├── when the pool cadence is not set
    │   ├── it emits PoolCadenceSet
    │   └── it sets the default cadence into the pool config
    └── when the pool cadence is set
        └── it preserves the pool cadence
